<title>POLAND: Polish broad money rises 1.4 pct in Dec 1-10 -NBP.</title>
<headline>Polish broad money rises 1.4 pct in Dec 1-10 -NBP.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland's broad money rose by 1.80 billion zlotys, or 1.4 percent, in the December 1-10 period after a 1.4 percent rise in the whole of November, preliminary central bank figures showed.  </p>
<p> BROAD POLISH MONEY		 DEC 1-10	NOV   DEC 1-10 95</p>
<p>  month/month change (pct)		1.4	1.4	   2.1</p>
<p>  Money in bln zlotys		   129.68   127.88	101.69</p>
<p>  Foreign currency (in bln PLN)	23.20    22.88	 20.96</p>
<p>  National currency		     106.48   105.00	 80.72</p>
<p>  Cash in circulation		    23.91    23.72	 19.51</p>
<p>  Lending to non-financial sector    77.83    76.94	 55.37</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
